    "eventDetail": "<p>Stryker will host an in-booth learning center during The National Teaching Institute &amp; Critical Care Exposition May 21-23, 2019, (exhibit dates) at the Orange County Convention Center in Orlando. The show offers 14 hours of exhibit time over three days, with 10 hours unopposed by clinical sessions.</p>\r\n<p>The Critical Care Exposition is the largest, most comprehensive trade show for acute and critical care nurses, advanced practice nurses, clinical nurse specialists, nurse practitioners and nurse managers as well as progressive care, transport and emergency department nurses who treat critically ill patients.</p>\r\n<p>Come get up-to-date information on topics such as current trends in resuscitation, fall prevention, safe patient handling and the neurological implications of fever. Each 30-minute session is approved for 0.5 CERPs. No preregistration is required.</p>\r\n",
